    "checkpoint": "CP-0029",
    "id": "P5-TRITON-VECADD-07-FRESH-SCHEMA8",
    "boundary": "Apply the test-only queue mock ordering fix without weakening production fail-closed semantics, prove serial and concurrent queue-test stability, and build a fresh schema-8 repository-local prefix with complete verify, OpenCL, Triton, and isolation evidence. Never reuse the NON-PASSING v6/v7 partial prefixes. Enter the model operator matrix immediately afterward; profile only if a real workload materially blocks progress."
  },
